# Farm-specific checkpoints: everything under weights/ is excluded by default,
# except the one current, working checkpoint (un-ignored below) tracked via
# Git LFS. Superseded/experimental variants and the known-leaky legacy
# checkpoint stay local only -- see weights/README.md.
weights/*.pt
weights/*.pth
weights/backups/
weights/ablation/*.pt
!weights/ablation/20260907_stage_a_torchvision_finetune.pt
